{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2023-06-15 15:57:00', 'title': 'SOUTHERN COMPANY GAS WINS TOP INDUSTRY HONORS FOR NATIONAL 811 DAY SAFE DIGGING COMMUNICATIONS CAMPAIGN', 'text': 'EMPLOYEE-INSPIRED SAFETY CAMPAIGN IS AN INDUSTRY-FIRST PARTNERSHIP WITH THE NATIONAL EXCAVATOR INITIATIVE ATLANTA, JUNE 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THERE IS A UNIVERSE OF INFRASTRUCTURE UNDER EVERY MAJOR STREET IN AMERICA – EVERYTHING FROM NATURAL GAS PIPELINES TO WATER AND SEWER LINES, CABLE, FIBER OPTICS AND ELECTRICAL LINES. IN RECOGNITION OF ITS EFFORTS TO PROMOTE SAFE DIGGING NEAR NATURAL GAS PIPELINE INFRASTRUCTURE, SOUTHERN COMPANY GAS IS HONORED TO WIN THE 2023 SOUTHERN GAS ASSOCIATION CORPORATE COMMUNICATIONS AWARD.'}